abstract: "Reproducible computational note: elementary re-derivation of a reduction of a tightened Goldbach statement to a paired Jacobsthal bound; exhaustive verification of h2(k) for k=3..11; sieve-dimension barrier discussion. No proof claimed."
keywords: [Goldbach, Jacobsthal function, sieve methods, reproducibility]
